        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Our Board determines the level of risk we are willing to accept in pursuit of our objectives, through the ERM program and well-defined risk appetite statements developed thereunder.",
