        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also subject to the proxy rules, tender offer rules, insider trading restrictions, annual and periodic reporting, and other requirements of the Exchange Act.",
