        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We currently sell low-yielding fixed-rate residential mortgage loans with maturities of more than 15 years, and on a more limited basis, those with maturities of 15 years or less, while retaining all adjustable-rate residential mortgage loans.",
